 External function subprogram "foealfa"
  (inc)(line-no.)(nest)(optimize)
               1                     !--------------------------------------------------------
               2                     ! external functions
               3                     !------------------------------------------------------
               4                           real function foealfa(tt)
               5                           use mo_constants, only:rtwat,   &
               6                                                  rtice
               7                     !     foealfa is calculated to distinguish the three cases:
               8                     !
               9                     !                       foealfa=1            water phase
              10                     !                       foealfa=0            ice phase
              11                     !                       0 < foealfa < 1      mixed phase
              12                     !
              13                     !               input : tt = temperature
              14                     !
              15                             implicit none
              16                             real tt
              17                              foealfa = min(1.,((max(rtice,min(rtwat,tt))-rtice) &
              18                          &  /(rtwat-rtice))**2)
              19                     
              20                             return
              21                           end function foealfa

